        "heading": "Buy GHOST® Lifestyle Supplements in India — Legend, Whey, Pump & Burn Complete Guide",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": "h4",
        "text": "<p>Looking to buy authentic <strong>GHOST® Lifestyle supplements in India</strong> without exorbitant overseas shipping rates, courier delays, or surprise customs duties at your doorstep? At <strong>Unmatched Supply</strong> (formerly Unmatched Kicks), we make ordering <strong>GHOST supplements in India</strong> transparent, reliable, and accessible: every tub is sourced from vetted US distributors, physically inspected at our Khar West, Mumbai facility, billed in final INR, and dispatched Pan-India with zero hidden customs charges.</p><h3>What Sets GHOST® Lifestyle Apart in Sports Nutrition?</h3><p>Founded in Chicago, USA, GHOST® Lifestyle revolutionized the fitness industry by becoming the first brand to introduce <strong>100% label transparency</strong> across all products. Unlike legacy supplement companies that hide doses behind proprietary blends, GHOST declares the exact milligram quantity of every single active ingredient right on the tub. From premium clinical dosages of pure L-Citrulline, Beta-Alanine, and Nitrosigine® in their pre-workouts to high-percentage whey isolate blends and licensed flavor collaborations with <strong>Welch's®</strong>, <strong>Bubblicious®</strong>, <strong>Sour Strips®</strong>, <strong>Chips Ahoy!®</strong>, and <strong>OREO®</strong>, GHOST sets the gold standard for taste, mixability, and workout performance.</p><h3>GHOST® Product Lineup Stocked Across India Drops</h3><ul><li><strong>GHOST LEGEND® Pre-Workout (30 Servings):</strong> The flagship energy, focus, and pump formula. Packed with 4g pure L-Citrulline, 3.2g Beta-Alanine, 1.5g Nitrosigine®, Senactiv®, Alpha-GPC, NeuroFactor®, and 250mg natural caffeine. Available in iconic collabs including <strong>Welch's® Concord Grape</strong>, <strong>Bubblicious® Strawberry Splash</strong>, <strong>Sour Strips®</strong>, and <strong>Blue Raspberry</strong>.</li><li><strong>GHOST® WHEY Protein (2 lb Tub / ~26–28 Servings):</strong> A 100% disclosed tri-blend featuring 12.5g Whey Protein Isolate 90%, 10g Whey Protein Concentrate 80%, and 2.5g Hydrolyzed Whey Isolate per scoop (25g total protein), fortified with DigeZyme® digestive enzymes. Legendary flavor drops include <strong>Chips Ahoy!®</strong> (with real crunchy chocolate chip cookie pieces), <strong>OREO®</strong>, <strong>Nutter Butter®</strong>, <strong>Cinnabon®</strong>, and <strong>Cereal Milk®</strong>.</li><li><strong>GHOST® PUMP (Nitric Oxide / Stim-Free Pre-Workout):</strong> Formulated with NO3-T® Arginine Nitrate, pure L-Citrulline, GlycerSize™, and AstraGin® for skin-splitting muscle fullness, vascularity, and endurance without any caffeine. Perfect for evening workouts or stacking with GHOST Legend.</li><li><strong>GHOST® BURN (Thermogenic Metabolic Matrix):</strong> Advanced fat-loss accelerator featuring 1.5g L-Carnitine Tartrate + 500mg Acetyl-L-Carnitine, CaloriBurn GP® (Grains of Paradise), GBB, Capsimax®, and clean smooth energy. Available in flavors like <strong>Warheads® Sour Apple</strong> and <strong>Welch's® Grape</strong>.</li></ul><h3>How to Choose the Right GHOST® Supplement for Your Fitness Goals</h3><ul><li><strong>For Maximum Workout Energy &amp; Focus:</strong> Choose <strong>GHOST LEGEND®</strong>. Take 1 to 2 scoops 20–30 minutes before training to unlock sustained energy, laser focus, and heavy muscle pumps without harsh jitters or post-workout crashes.</li><li><strong>For Lean Muscle Growth &amp; Protein Intake:</strong> Choose <strong>GHOST® WHEY</strong>. Take 1 scoop post-workout or between meals for 25g of high-bioavailability protein with authentic dessert-milkshake taste and easy digestion.</li><li><strong>For Caffeine-Free Pumps or Late-Night Training:</strong> Choose <strong>GHOST® PUMP</strong>. Experience full nitric oxide blood flow and vascularity without stimulants, keeping your sleep cycle intact.</li><li><strong>For Cutting &amp; Caloric Deficits:</strong> Choose <strong>GHOST® BURN</strong> to support thermogenesis, sweat production, and mental clarity during calorie-restricted phases.</li></ul><h3>Mumbai Authenticity Inspection &amp; Pan-India Courier Delivery</h3><ul><li><strong>Zero Surprise Customs Invoices:</strong> Unlike cross-border websites where Indian buyers face 42%–77% import duty plus customs broker clearance charges at delivery, Unmatched Supply stocks inventory domestically in India. The checkout price in INR is completely final.</li><li><strong>Verified at Khar West, Mumbai:</strong> Our team inspects every incoming tub for manufacturer shrink-wrap seal integrity, lot numbers, best-by dates, and climate-controlled storage conditions at Shop No 2, Kashi Kunj, Khar West, Plot No 27, 3rd Road, Mumbai 400052 before packing.</li><li><strong>Fast Dispatch Across India:</strong> We deliver Pan-India through tracked courier partners with Instant Ship options on ready inventory, and free shipping applies on orders above ₹14,999. Contact our team anytime via WhatsApp at <strong>+91 77100 96203</strong> or <a href=\"mailto:unmatchedkicks@gmail.com\">unmatchedkicks@gmail.com</a>.</li></ul><p>Explore more authentic imported nutrition and activewear: <a href=\"/collections/supplements-instant-ship\">Instant Ship Supplements</a>, <a href=\"/collections/david-protein\">David Protein Bars India</a>, <a href=\"/collections/quest-protein-bars\">Quest Protein Bars</a>, <a href=\"/collections/barbell-protein-bar\">Barbell Protein Bars</a>, and <a href=\"/pages/about-us\">About Unmatched Supply</a>.</p>",
